    icon: '🃏',
  },
  data: {
    LLM: 'A pyramid of cards is built face-down (6-5-4-3-2-1). Each player receives cards face-down, looks once to memorise them, then may not look again. Cards are revealed from the pyramid one by one (bottom row left to right, then next row). When a card is revealed, any player may claim to hold the same face value and assign a penalty (drinks) to another player; that player may accept or call bluff. If bluff is called and the claimer had the card, the assigned player drinks double; if the claimer was bluffing, the claimer drinks double. Number of drinks often equals the pyramid row (e.g. row 3 = 3 drinks). Game ends when the pyramid is fully revealed.',
    Player: 'A pyramid of cards is built face-down (6-5-4-3-2-1). Each player receives cards face-down, looks once to memorise them, then may not look again. Cards are revealed from the pyramid one by one (bottom row left to right, then next row). When a card is revealed, any player may claim to hold the same face value and assign a penalty (drinks) to another player; that player may accept or call bluff. If bluff is called and the claimer had the card, the assigned player drinks double; if the claimer was bluffing, the claimer drinks double. Number of drinks often equals the pyramid row (e.g. row 3 = 3 drinks). Game ends when the pyramid is fully revealed.',
    objective: 'Avoid penalties by remembering your cards and successfully bluffing your opponents.',
    gameplay: 'A pyramid of cards is built face-down (6-5-4-3-2-1). Each player receives cards face-down, looks once to memorise them, then may not look again. Cards are revealed from the pyramid one by one (bottom row left to right, then next row). When a card is revealed, any player may claim to hold the same face value and assign a penalty (drinks) to another player; that player may accept or call bluff. If bluff is called and the claimer had the card, the assigned player drinks double; if the claimer was bluffing, the claimer drinks double. Number of drinks often equals the pyramid row (e.g. row 3 = 3 drinks). Game ends when the pyramid is fully revealed.',
    keyRules: [
      'Memorise your hand once; no looking again.',
      'Match revealed pyramid card by face value to assign penalty to an opponent.',
      'Target may accept the penalty or call bluff; wrong call doubles the penalty.',
      'Optional: summit (top) card may count for more; wrong card when called costs double.',
    ],
